  "content": "[Intro]\n[Fmaj7]\n\n[Section A]\n[Fmaj7]Castaways,\nwe are\ncastaways,\nAhoy\nthere, ahoy,\n[F#dim7]we are\n[Gm7]castaways\n[C9]We're\n[Gm7]stuck where we are\n[C9]with no\n[Gm7]house, no car,\n[C9]\n[Gm7]Castaways, ahoy,\n[C9]we are\n[Fmaj7]castaways\n\n[Section B]\n[Dm7]We were out at sea\n[G13]on a\n[Cmaj7]sailing ship\nThe\n[Cm7]rain began to rain\n[F13]and the\n[Bbmaj7]wind began to whip\nWe\n[Bm7b5]felt the ship tip,\n[E7]it was\n[Am7]going down\nSo we\n[D9]launched our lifeboat\nso we\n[G13]wouldn't drown\n[C9]\n\n[Section A]\n[Fmaj7]Castaways,\nwe are\ncastaways,\nAhoy\nthere, ahoy,\n[F#dim7]we are\n[Gm7]castaways\n[C9]On an\n[Gm7]island at sea\n[C9]Just\n[Gm7]me, me, and me\n[C9]\n[Gm7]Castaways, ahoy,\n[C9]we are\n[Fmaj7]castaways\n\n[Outro]\n[Fmaj7]",
